      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.851" />
          <code code="47039-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Ricovero, anamnesi e visita medica" />
          <title>Inquadramento Clinico</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Paziente ricoverata per accertamenti. Anamnesi: ipertensione arteriosa in terapia. Esame obiettivo: parametri vitali nella norma.</paragraph>
          </text>
          <author typeCode="AUT" contextControlCode="OP">
            <time value="20250507090000+0100" />
            <assignedAuthor>
              <id root="2.16.840.1.113883.2.9.4.3.2" extension="PROVAX00X00X000Y" />
              <assignedPerson>
                <name>
                  <given>Mario</given>
                  <family>Bianchi</family>
                </name>
              </assignedPerson>
            </assignedAuthor>
          </author>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.844" />
          <code code="67851-6" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Ricovero, nota di valutazione" />
          <title>Accertamento Assistenziale</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Valutazione infermieristica all'ingresso: paziente collaborante, autonoma nelle ADL.</paragraph>
          </text>
          <author typeCode="AUT" contextControlCode="OP">
            <time value="20250507090000+0100" />
            <assignedAuthor>
              <id root="2.16.840.1.113883.2.9.4.3.2" extension="VRDMRC67T20I257E" />
              <assignedPerson>
                <name>
                  <given>Anna</given>
                  <family>Verdi</family>
                </name>
              </assignedPerson>
            </assignedAuthor>
          </author>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.852" />
          <code code="48765-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Allergies and adverse reactions Document" />
          <title>Allergie e Intolleranze</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Allergia a penicillina documentata. Intolleranza al lattosio.</paragraph>
          </text>
          <author typeCode="AUT" contextControlCode="OP">
            <time value="20250507090000+0100" />
            <assignedAuthor>
              <id root="2.16.840.1.113883.2.9.4.3.2" extension="PROVAX00X00X000Y" />
              <assignedPerson>
                <name>
                  <given>Mario</given>
                  <family>Bianchi</family>
                </name>
              </assignedPerson>
            </assignedAuthor>
          </author>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.853" />
          <code code="84172-6" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Interdisciplinary Hospital Plan of care note" />
          <title>Processo Terapeutico</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Terapia farmacologica: Ramipril 5mg/die, Furosemide 25mg/die. Terapia infusionale: soluzione fisiologica 500ml.</paragraph>
          </text>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.854" />
          <code code="8716-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Vital signs note" />
          <title>Parametri</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>PA: 130/80 mmHg. FC: 72 bpm. Temp: 36.5 C. SpO2: 98%. Peso: 65 kg. Altezza: 165 cm.</paragraph>
          </text>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.855" />
          <code code="83734-4" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Physical medicine and rehabilitation Interdisciplinary Plan of care note" />
          <title>Piano Riabilitativo Individuale</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Piano riabilitativo individuale: fisioterapia respiratoria quotidiana, mobilizzazione precoce.</paragraph>
          </text>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.856" />
          <code code="101541-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Multidisciplinary Comprehensive plan of care note" />
          <title>Piano Assistenziale Individuale</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Piano assistenziale individuale: monitoraggio parametri vitali ogni 4 ore, gestione accessi venosi.</paragraph>
          </text>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.865" />
          <code code="59284-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Consent Document" />
          <title>Consensi</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Consenso informato al trattamento sanitario acquisito e firmato dal paziente.</paragraph>
          </text>
          <entry>
            <observationMedia moodCode="EVN" classCode="OBS">
              <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.866" />
              <value xsi:type="ED" mediaType="application/pdf" representation="B64"></value>
            </observationMedia>
          </entry>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.857" />
          <code code="11487-6" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Consultation request (narrative)" />
          <title>Richieste</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Richiesta ecografia addome completo. Richiesta visita cardiologica.</paragraph>
          </text>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.849" />
          <code code="11506-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Progress note" />
          <title>Diario Clinico Assistenziale</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>07/05 ore 09:00 - Paziente in buone condizioni generali. Apiressia. PA stabile.</paragraph>
          </text>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.843" />
          <code code="70007-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Restraint note" />
          <title>Provvedimento Contenitivo e/o di Altra Natura</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Nessun provvedimento contenitivo applicato durante il ricovero.</paragraph>
          </text>
          <entry>
            <observationMedia moodCode="EVN" classCode="OBS">
              <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.866" />
              <value xsi:type="ED" mediaType="application/pdf" representation="B64"></value>
            </observationMedia>
          </entry>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section>
          <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.63.10.841" />
          <code code="34750-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Anesthesia records" />
          <title>Documentazione Anestesiologica</title>
          <text>
            <paragraph>Valutazione anestesiologica pre-operatoria: paziente ASA II. Anestesia generale programmata.</paragraph>
          </text>
          <author typeCode="AUT" contextControlCode="OP">
            <time value="20250508080000+0100" />
            <assignedAuthor>
              <id root="2.16.840.1.113883.2.9.4.3.2" extension="BNCLCU80A01H501Y" />
